5\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1:未打印 2:已打印</span></p><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"6\" data-cell=\"5\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">传值则根据条件筛选</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row=\"7\"><td data-row=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"7\" data-cell=\"1\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">最小金额</span></p></td><td data-row=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"7\" data-cell=\"2\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">begamt</span></p></td><td data-row=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"7\" data-cell=\"3\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">M</span></p></td><td data-row=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"7\" data-cell=\"4\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><br></p></td><td data-row=\"7\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"7\" data-cell=\"5\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">13位整数 +&